    "final_answer": "I've found the recipe. Let me record the key findings:\n\n**Recipe Found: Debbie's Vegetable Lasagna**\n- **URL**: https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/240375/debbies-vegetable-lasagna/\n- **Rating**: 4.7 stars (★★★★½) — well above the 4-star requirement ✓\n- **Number of ratings**: 20 ratings, 14 reviews\n- **Vegetarian**: Yes (categorized as \"VEGETARIAN LASAGNA RECIPES\") ✓\n- **Contains Zucchini**: Yes — \"2 cups coarsely chopped zucchini\" ✓\n- **Prep Time**: 25 mins\n- **Cook Time**: 45 mins\n- **Total Time**: 1 hr 10 mins\n- **Servings**: 8\n\n**Ingredients include**:\n- 9 lasagna noodles\n- ¼ cup margarine\n- ¼ cup all-purpose flour\n- ½ teaspoon salt\n- ¼ teaspoon ground black pepper\n- 1 cup milk\n- ½ cup vegetable broth\n- 2 tablespoons white wine\n- ½ cup grated Parmesan cheese\n- 1 cup light ricotta cheese\n- 1 egg, 1 egg white\n- 1 tablespoon olive oil\n- 2 cups coarsely shredded carrots\n- **2 cups coarsely chopped zucchini** ✓\n- 1 (10 ounce) package frozen chopped spinach, thawed\n- 1 cup shredded mozzarella cheese\n\n## Summary\n\nI successfully found a vegetarian lasagna recipe that meets all the criteria:\n\n**\"Debbie's Vegetable Lasagna\"** on Allrecipes.com has a **4.7-star rating** (well above the 4-star minimum), is vegetarian, and uses **zucchini** as an ingredient (2 cups of coarsely chopped zucchini). You can view the full recipe at: https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/240375/debbies-vegetable-lasagna/\n\nNote: Another recipe I checked, \"Lisa's Lasagne\" (also from the search results), is categorized as a \"ZUCCHINI LASAGNA RECIPE\" but only had a 3.9 rating, so it did not meet the 4-star threshold.",
